Package: cefbrowser
Architecture: amd64
Depends:
 ${shlibs:Depends},
 ${misc:Depends},
 vdr-plugin-web
Description: Chromium Embedded Framework browser for VDR HbbTV
 cefbrowser renders HbbTV applications for the VDR web plugin and exchanges
 browser control and presentation data over the shared Thrift interfaces.
 .
 This package carries the CEF 126 runtime required by cefbrowser and is built
 from the rellla fixes integration used by the VDR-Suite HbbTV stack.
